horseman headless~
the Headless Horseman~
The Headless Horseman sweeps through the square atop a spectral steed!
~
The Headless Horseman looms before you: an undead warrior of terrifying power
astride a massive black horse wreathed in ghostly flame. Where a head should
rest sits only empty air above the blood-soaked collar of blackened plate. He
raises a burning scythe and the air reeks of grave-dirt and rot.
~
