#29911
father winter ancient~
Father Winter~
Father Winter strides through the square, frost crackling in his wake!
~
Father Winter towers before you: an ancient, terrifying figure with a vast
white beard rimed with ice and blazing blue eyes that hold no warmth at all.
His fur-trimmed coat crackles with cold and his fists are wreathed in frost.
He does not appear jolly in the least bit.
~
