#29930
hexley madame hallows merchant~
Madame Hexley the Hallows End merchant~
Madame Hexley wanders the square, her cart of Halloween wares following behind.
~
A gaunt woman dressed in tattered black robes covered in embroidered cobwebs
and orange silk trim.  Her wide-brimmed hat is adorned with tiny carved
pumpkins, and a floating cart of holiday goods bobs behind her on ghostly
chains.  Despite her eerie appearance, her smile is genuinely welcoming.
~
